SETTINGS VERIFIED IDENTICAL to our runs, read out of the build directory, not assumed:
clock_period 3.33, topographical true, flatten_effort 3, nthreads 16, gate_clock true,
high_effort_area_opt false, uniquify_with_design_name false, write_svsim_wrapper false,
adk view-standard, DC W-2024.09. The SDC reads create_clock [get_ports clock] -period 3.33,
against ap_clk on our side -- the port name differs, the constraint does not. stdcells.db
matches ours by md5 (f5560259ca91a4b67336b715b729f94d). design_name/top_module are Gemmini.

